{"seq":2,"slug":"swing-physics","title":"摆荡物理：单摆、能量与那一下「甩出去」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope/swing-physics","wordCount":1498,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"摆荡物理-单摆-能量与那一下-甩出去\">摆荡物理：单摆、能量与那一下「甩出去」</h1><p>约束把玩家钉在球面上之后，重力接手了。玩家沿球面下坠、在最低点获得最大速度、冲上对面再减速——这就是单摆。抓钩最上瘾的那一下爽感，几乎全部来自这里：荡到低点积累速度、在恰当的角度松手、身体拉成一道弧线飞出去。这一篇讲摆荡的物理，尤其是最容易被做砸的部分——<strong>松手瞬间动量必须被完整保留</strong>。上一篇负责把玩家钉在球面上，这一篇负责让他在球面上荡得像回事。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-绳约束下的玩家就是一个单摆\">核心概念：绳约束下的玩家就是一个单摆</h2><p>一旦距离约束生效、玩家在球面上运动，系统就是一个（受重力的）单摆。把运动分解到两个方向最清楚：沿绳的<strong>径向</strong>被约束吃掉，垂直绳的<strong>切向</strong>由重力的切向分量驱动。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[玩家在球面上,绳与竖直成角 θ] --&gt; B[重力 mg 分解]&#10;  B --&gt; C[径向分量 mg·cosθ&lt;br/&gt;被绳约束抵消]&#10;  B --&gt; D[切向分量 mg·sinθ&lt;br/&gt;驱动摆荡加速]&#10;  D --&gt; E[向最低点加速]&#10;  E --&gt; F[最低点: 切向速度最大]&#10;  F --&gt; G[冲向对侧,切向分量反向减速]\">graph TD\n  A[玩家在球面上,绳与竖直成角 θ] --&gt; B[重力 mg 分解]\n  B --&gt; C[径向分量 mg·cosθ&lt;br/&gt;被绳约束抵消]\n  B --&gt; D[切向分量 mg·sinθ&lt;br/&gt;驱动摆荡加速]\n  D --&gt; E[向最低点加速]\n  E --&gt; F[最低点: 切向速度最大]\n  F --&gt; G[冲向对侧,切向分量反向减速]</pre><p>设绳与竖直方向夹角为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，切向加速度为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t = -g\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>负号表示它总是把玩家往最低点（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）拉。小角度下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin\\theta\\approx\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span>，退化成简谐运动，周期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msqrt><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T = 2\\pi\\sqrt{L/g}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.305em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.935em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.895em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.305em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>——绳越长摆得越慢。但抓钩里玩家常大幅摆动，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 不能线性近似，直接用完整式子做数值积分即可（反正你已经在固定步里跑约束了，见 <a href=\"rope-constraint\">1_rope-constraint.md</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"能量守恒-为什么低点最快\">能量守恒：为什么低点最快</h2><p>理解摆荡手感的钥匙是能量守恒。摆荡中，重力势能和动能来回转换，总量（无阻尼时）不变：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext>const</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}mv^2 + mgh = \\text{const}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">const</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>玩家从高处荡下，高度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 减小、势能转成动能，速度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 在最低点达到峰值；冲上对面，动能又转回势能，在等高处速度归零。这解释了两个手感事实：<strong>低点最快</strong>（所以玩家学会在低点松手求最大速度）、以及<strong>无损时荡不过起始高度</strong>（能量守恒不允许凭空变高）。</p>\n<p>现实中你会加一点阻尼（空气阻力项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-cv</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>）让摆荡自然收敛，否则玩家永远荡不停。但阻尼要小——阻尼一大，能量流失快，「荡两下就没劲」，爽感全无。这是「动量诚实」维度的核心：玩家的直觉就是能量守恒，任何偷偷抽走能量的做法都会被身体察觉。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>高度 h</th>\n<th>势能</th>\n<th>动能</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起始（最高）</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中途</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最低点</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>峰值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对侧等高点</td>\n<td>回到最大</td>\n<td>最大</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"松手守恒-抓钩的高潮\">松手守恒：抓钩的高潮</h2><p>如果说摆荡是蓄势，松手就是释放，而释放的全部意义在于——<strong>玩家荡到的速度，要一分不少地带进接下来的自由飞行</strong>。这是抓钩里最容易做砸、也最该做对的一件事。</p>\n<p>正确做法：松手时，把当前的切向速度矢量原样赋给玩家的自由运动速度，然后解除约束。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"void Detach() {&#10;    // v 是摆荡这一帧的实际速度(切向为主)&#10;    playerVelocity = currentSwingVelocity; // 原样保留,不清零、不缩放&#10;    phase = Phase.Detached;&#10;    // 之后玩家做抛物线自由飞行&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>void Detach() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // v 是摆荡这一帧的实际速度(切向为主)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    playerVelocity = currentSwingVelocity; // 原样保留,不清零、不缩放</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    phase = Phase.Detached;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 之后玩家做抛物线自由飞行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见做砸的方式，每一种都会杀死爽感：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>松手清零速度</strong>：玩家荡了半天，松手却「啪」地掉下去。最致命，等于告诉玩家摆荡毫无意义。</li>\n<li><strong>松手后速度立刻衰减</strong>：Detached 状态里加了过大空气阻力，甩出去的弧线迅速缩短，释放没有回报。</li>\n<li><strong>约束方向残留</strong>：解除约束时没把「沿绳方向」处理干净，玩家带着一个诡异的径向速度飞出，弧线不自然。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>许多高速抓钩（《Titanfall 2》风格）甚至<strong>略微放大</strong>末速度，或在低点松手时给一点奖励加成，鼓励玩家追求完美时机——这把「蓄势—释放」的节奏曲线（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-grappling\">1_foundations/1_why-grappling.md</a>）推到极致。放大多少是纯手感调参，见 <a href=\"../practice/grapple-feel\">4_practice/1_grapple-feel.md</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[摆荡中,积累切向速度] --&gt; B{玩家松手}&#10;  B --&gt; C[读取当前速度矢量 v]&#10;  C --&gt; D[原样赋给自由运动速度&lt;br/&gt;可选:略微放大]&#10;  D --&gt; E[解除距离约束]&#10;  E --&gt; F[Detached: 抛物线飞行&lt;br/&gt;交还空中操控]&#10;  F --&gt; G[落点 / 再次抓钩]\">flowchart TD\n  A[摆荡中,积累切向速度] --&gt; B{玩家松手}\n  B --&gt; C[读取当前速度矢量 v]\n  C --&gt; D[原样赋给自由运动速度&lt;br/&gt;可选:略微放大]\n  D --&gt; E[解除距离约束]\n  E --&gt; F[Detached: 抛物线飞行&lt;br/&gt;交还空中操控]\n  F --&gt; G[落点 / 再次抓钩]</pre><h2 id=\"主动注入能量-泵动与空中控制\">主动注入能量：泵动与空中控制</h2><p>纯被动单摆荡不过起始高度，但玩家想「越荡越高」。真实秋千靠身体泵动（改变重心）注入能量；游戏里等价的手段是让玩家在摆荡中通过输入<strong>沿切向施加小推力</strong>，或在特定相位允许卷收绳子（缩短 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 相当于对系统做功，见 <a href=\"reel-in-out\">3_reel-in-out.md</a>）。给一点切向输入加速度，玩家就能主动增幅摆荡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>input</mtext><mtext>tangential</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a_t = -g\\sin\\theta + k\\,(\\text{input}_\\text{tangential})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1302em;vertical-align:-0.3802em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">input</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.242em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tangential</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3802em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 要小心：太大玩家能无视物理随意加速，「动量诚实」崩塌；太小玩家觉得使不上劲。它和空中操控（Detached 后能不能微调方向）一起，构成「掌控感」维度的主要旋钮。空中控制的手感取舍见 <a href=\"../practice/grapple-feel\">4_practice/1_grapple-feel.md</a>，其对镜头的连带影响见 <a href=\"../practice/grapple-camera\">4_practice/2_grapple-camera.md</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>绳约束下的玩家就是<strong>单摆</strong>：径向被约束吃掉，切向由重力分量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>g</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-g\\sin\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">sin</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 驱动；大摆角别用小角度近似。</li>\n<li><strong>能量守恒</strong>解释一切手感：低点最快、无损荡不过起始高度；阻尼要小，否则「荡两下没劲」。</li>\n<li><strong>松手守恒是抓钩高潮</strong>：末速度必须原样带进自由飞行，清零/过阻尼/径向残留三种做法都会杀死爽感，高速风格甚至略微放大末速度。</li>\n<li><strong>主动注入能量</strong>（切向输入推力、边荡边收绳）让玩家越荡越高，但增益系数要小以守住「动量诚实」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"rope-constraint\">绳索约束</a>——本篇摆荡建立在其球面约束之上。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"reel-in-out\">卷收与放绳</a>——改变绳长向摆荡系统注入/抽取能量。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../foundations/why-grappling\">为何抓钩机制</a>——「蓄势—释放」节奏的设计动因。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/newtonian-mechanics\">物理 · 牛顿力学</a>——单摆与能量守恒的力学基础。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../vehicle-physics/foundations/vehicle-physics-overview\">车辆物理 · 总览</a>——高速载具中同源的动量保留问题。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>来源：单摆与能量守恒为经典力学；「swing behaves like a pendulum until it can get rotating」的实践观察来自 gameidea.org Godot 抓钩教程（2024）；松手动量保留为抓钩设计通识。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"摆荡物理：单摆、能量与那一下「甩出去」","id":"摆荡物理-单摆-能量与那一下-甩出去"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：绳约束下的玩家就是一个单摆","id":"核心概念-绳约束下的玩家就是一个单摆"},{"level":2,"text":"能量守恒：为什么低点最快","id":"能量守恒-为什么低点最快"},{"level":2,"text":"松手守恒：抓钩的高潮","id":"松手守恒-抓钩的高潮"},{"level":2,"text":"主动注入能量：泵动与空中控制","id":"主动注入能量-泵动与空中控制"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"绳索约束：把玩家钉在一个球面上","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope/rope-constraint"},"next":{"title":"卷收与放绳：让绳长成为一个可玩的旋钮","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-grappling-hook/rope/reel-in-out"}}